    "evidence": "SetBytesPerFrame lines27-140; MOV_ReadMovieFile lines247-252; MOV_ReadJoy lines610-665; MOV_ReadControl lines1025-1049. Physical length overrides summary count; text button semantics are byte != dot; field offsets skip separator bytes."
